<title>UK: Nearby LIFFE sugar higher ends firmer.</title>
<headline>Nearby LIFFE sugar higher ends firmer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nearby LIFFE white sugar futures ended a light pre-holiday trading session firmer, after trading tightly mixed for much of the day.</p>
<p>Front month August last traded $3.00 higher at $313.70. Volume on August was 999 lots of a total of 1,799.</p>
<p>The market is closed on Monday, May 5 for a holiday. It reopens on Tuesday, May 6.</p>
<p>((--London newsroom +44 171 542 7928))</p>
